Feature: 78258 Flights - Push notification displayed on flight results page
  As a corporate traveler with a generic flight push notification configured
  I want the "New Trip FLT" push notification to be displayed on the results page
  So that I receive real-time feedback when starting a flight booking flow

  Scenario: Generic "New Trip FLT" push notification is displayed on flight results page
    Given I am logged in as "Notification@Notification.com" booking a new trip
    And I have added myself as the traveler
    When I search for a one way flight from "LON" to "MAD"
    Then I should see mandatory notifications with message "New Trip FLT"
